# Core Library for JNLISP

Here we define all the source code for standard programming functionality
not included as go primitives in the corresponding go library.  This library 
does not need to be imported with `(import stdlib)`, it will be included
in the global environment by default.

## Logic programming

Defined as go bindings are "and", "or", "not", ">", and "=".  The rest
are derived here in lisp.

### Less than

j(define (< a b)
  (and (not (> a b)) (not (= a b))))

### Greater than or equal to

j(define (>= a b)
  (or (> a b) (= a b)))

### Less than or equal to

j(define (<= a b)
  (or (< a b) (= a b)))

